    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just being overwhelmed. it's more like... there's a difference between having a hard time and just being fundamentally flawed. i feel like i've reached the end of my rope and there's nothing on the other side. honestly, it feels more logical to just accept that i'm done than to keep pretending things can get better.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
